		{"id":"b64b37ea94fb70f7","type":"file","file":"Others note/Untitled.md","x":-6800,"y":440,"width":600,"height":1160},
		{"id":"32bfca651c697669","type":"text","text":"Samajh gaya — tu **4th semester me hai**, aur tujhe ek **clear roadmap chahiye: C++ → skills → next steps → career direction**.  \nMain tujhe ek **practical, no-BS roadmap** deta hoon jo tu follow kare toh strong developer ban sakta hai.\n\n---\n\n# 🚀 PHASE 1: Strong C++ Foundation (2–4 weeks)\n\n## 🎯 Goal: Syntax nahi, **thinking develop karna**\n\n![Image](https://www.simplilearn.com/ice9/free_resources_article_thumb/C%2B%2B_Basics_Example1.PNG)\n\n![Image](https://miro.medium.com/v2/resize%3Afit%3A1400/0%2AwmyZIQ3yLwGrm9WA.gif)\n\n![Image](https://files.codingninjas.in/article_images/recursion-tree-method-1-1644059774.webp)\n\n![Image](https://i.sstatic.net/zmshy.png)\n\n### 🔹 Topics (must master)\n\n- Basics (already done ✔)\n    \n- Pointers (VERY IMPORTANT)\n    \n- OOP (class, inheritance, polymorphism)\n    \n- STL (vector, map, set, stack, queue)\n    \n- Recursion\n    \n\n### 🔹 Practice\n\n- Daily 5–10 questions:\n    \n    - HackerRank\n        \n    - LeetCode\n        \n\n### 🗣️ English Practice\n\n> I am learning C++ fundamentals and improving my problem-solving skills.\n\n---\n\n# ⚡ PHASE 2: DSA (Main Game) – 2–3 months\n\n## 🎯 Goal: Placement + logic power\n\n![Image](https://www.sahinarslan.tech/static/f0f154c04b1c5399e973609a7f4a2cf3/3d469/binary-tree-traversals.jpg)\n\n![Image](https://miro.medium.com/1%2ALD7BdFUBTva2d-Nuj1BRQA.png)\n\n![Image](https://www.researchgate.net/profile/Ghassan-Shobaki/publication/260400108/figure/fig14/AS%3A669385958109191%401536605457409/Dynamic-programming-table-for-solving-the-exit-combination-problem.png)\n\n![Image](https://favtutor.com/resources/images/uploads/mceu_60788241451631709268893.png)\n\n### 🔹 Topics\n\n- Arrays + Strings\n    \n- Linked List\n    \n- Stack / Queue\n    \n- Trees (MOST IMPORTANT)\n    \n- Graphs (basic)\n    \n- Dynamic Programming (basic)\n    \n\n### 🔹 Strategy\n\n- Solve 300–500 questions total\n    \n- Pattern samajh, ratta nahi\n    \n\n---\n\n# 🧠 PHASE 3: Choose Your Direction (IMPORTANT)\n\nAb sab log yahan confuse hote hain 👇  \nTu 3 paths me se choose karega:\n\n---\n\n## 💻 OPTION A: Software Developer (Best for placement)\n\n![Image](https://miro.medium.com/0%2A3M8OpMfN4Go1sB07)\n\n![Image](https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/%24s_%21g3db%21%2Cf_auto%2Cq_auto%3Agood%2Cfl_progressive%3Asteep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F4a38175b-11e8-40ae-879c-ab3ce2027089_2008x1252.png)\n\n![Image](https://webimages.mongodb.com/_com_assets/cms/lwtej2v2x5il7ng4y-image2.jpg?auto=format%252Ccompress)\n\n![Image](https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D5612AQEsrFD-J0QVZg/article-cover_image-shrink_720_1280/article-cover_image-shrink_720_1280/0/1702891964105?e=2147483647&t=-p0ZUdHIFQJwLS1zwlG7wzjOzfwu1YJF_gofgeGvXmY&v=beta)\n\n### 🔹 Learn:\n\n- HTML + CSS + JavaScript\n    \n- React\n    \n- Backend (Node.js / Java / Python)\n    \n- Database (MongoDB / MySQL)\n    \n\n### 🔹 Build Projects:\n\n- Portfolio website\n    \n- Chat app\n    \n- E-commerce\n    \n\n---\n\n## 🤖 OPTION B: Core + C++ (System / Game Dev)\n\n![Image](https://img-c.udemycdn.com/course/480x270/657932_c7e0_7.jpg)\n\n![Image](https://www.tutorialspoint.com/operating_system/images/process_swapping.jpg)\n\n![Image](https://www.researchgate.net/publication/234775119/figure/fig14/AS%3A651134616223762%401532253998591/a-Programming-a-real-microcontroller-often-requires-a-complex-flow-that-is-confusing-to.png)\n\n![Image](https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61LUke4jyLL._AC_UF1000%2C1000_QL80_.jpg)\n\n### 🔹 Learn:\n\n- Advanced C++\n    \n- OS basics\n    \n- Multithreading\n    \n- Game dev (Unreal Engine)\n    \n\n---\n\n## 🎨 OPTION C: Animation + Tech (Your interest 🔥)\n\n![Image](https://learn.toonboom.com/modules/animation-workflow/Resources/Images/HAR/Stage/Aimation_Workflows/cutout_workflow.png)\n\n![Image](https://res.cloudinary.com/upwork-cloud/image/upload/c_scale%2Cw_1000/v1722672868/catalog/1819645273179681582/c8on5bohg4uq1loqfwak.jpg)\n\n![Image](https://d1tq3fcx54x7ou.cloudfront.net/uploads/store/tenant_161/post/1631/image/large-278c8e249e7da3066f0280c0d5969658.png)\n\n![Image](https://d1tq3fcx54x7ou.cloudfront.net/uploads/store/tenant_161/templateswidget/6310/image/large-56e04dc294aaee1013be8beb5b9ffd24.jpeg)\n\n### 🔹 Learn:\n\n- 2D Animation (Toon Boom / Krita / Blender)\n    \n- Storytelling\n    \n- YouTube content creation\n    \n\n👉 Tu already interested hai isme — ye tera **unique advantage** hai\n\n---\n\n# 📅 DAILY ROUTINE (Perfect for you)\n\nTu bola tha tera schedule fixed hai, toh:\n\n### 🌅 Morning (4–9 AM)\n\n- 2 hr → DSA\n    \n- 2 hr → Development / Animation\n    \n\n### 🏫 After College\n\n- 1–2 hr → Practice / Project\n    \n\n---\n\n# 🔥 FINAL STRATEGY (MOST IMPORTANT)\n\n👉 80% log galti karte hain:\n\n- Sirf videos dekhte hain ❌\n    \n- Practice nahi karte ❌\n    \n\n👉 Tu kya kare:\n\n- Learn → Practice → Build → Repeat\n    \n\n---\n\n# 🗣️ English Practice (Daily)\n\n> I am building my skills step by step to become a strong developer.\n\n---\n\n# 🎯 NEXT STEP (Tell me)\n\nAb tu mujhe bol:\n\n1. **Placement chahiye (safe path)**\n    \n2. **Game / C++ deep (hard but powerful)**\n    \n3. **Animation + YouTube (creative + money)**\n    \n\n👉 Main uske according tujhe **exact roadmap + resources + daily plan** bana dunga (god level 🔥)","x":-6800,"y":0,"width":560,"height":398},
		{"id":"4324d2ac75890ab3","type":"file","file":"01_Programming 💻/C++ language/C++.md","x":-6800,"y":1680,"width":480,"height":1200},
